{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&lt;STORY&gt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After returning from Tokyo to the island where he once lived, Yuu Kirishima, the protagonist,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >reunites with his childhood friend, Hoshiumi Minase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hoshiumi, who had once dreamed of becoming an idol,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >now seems to have lost her sparkle and is on the verge of giving up on that dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wanting to see her smile again, Yuu makes a proposal\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to debut as a virtual idol named \u201cIsekai Joucho\u201d,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >based on an illustration he drew himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118810/extras/27bd6fa8861930151b711ed032979957.avif?t=1774227367\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&lt;SYSTEM&gt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fully voiced adventure game featuring a story-driven experience combined with a training system that lets you guide Hoshiumi on her path to becoming a top virtual idol.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on how you train her, Hoshiumi\u2019s growth, goals, and ultimately her destiny will change,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >leading to multiple possible endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118810/extras/fca2966c4eb341cbc00bae3b82658a36.avif?t=1774227367\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118810/extras/5f19a3308ac24ed2712d122f70f6f38c.avif?t=1774227367\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&lt;CHARACTERS&gt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hoshiumi Minase (CV: Isekaijoucho)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A perfectly ordinary girl who dreams of becoming an idol.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though she knows it might be impossible, she can\u2019t let go of her dream,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and continues to secretly practice singing and dancing alone on the school rooftop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yuu Kirishima</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After moving back from Tokyo due to his parents\u2019 transfer,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >he reunites with his childhood friend Hoshiumi and suggests that she pursue her dream</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by becoming a virtual idol.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isekai Joucho (CV: Isekaijoucho)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A virtual idol born from Yuu\u2019s illustration\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the other self of Hoshiumi Minase,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >who embodies her dream in the virtual world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruri Hasebe (CV: Yuuka Nohara)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious composer and Vocaloid producer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is also the head of the major VTuber agency \u201cTsubaki-iro Studio.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reina Maikawa (CV: China Kitahara)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A passionate dance trainer who guides Hoshiumi with fiery enthusiasm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saki Utakata (CV: Rin Tanka)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gentle vocal trainer who helps Hoshiumi find her true voice.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Virtual Ties \u30f0\u4e16\u754c\u60c5\u7dd2\u5922\u60f3\u66f2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4118810/9fe2949bda997f201d9980e1fed77847e9f7f79f.jpg"},{"name":"\u521d\u3081\u3066\u306e\u914d\u4fe1\uff01","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4118810/b33f30547ef30a6af6e20b2048e4eb019bed7aed.jpg"},{"name":"\u521d\u3081\u3066\u306e\u30e9\u30a4\u30d6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4118810/d01975d24adb57a44d15ce4b5396bb44225a1436.jpg"},{"name":"\u53ef\u80fd\u6027\u306f\u7121\u9650\u5927","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4118810/50abf04c90482dc92130a84c2a015efb21015cca.jpg"},{"name":"\u30de\u30a4\u30af\u3092\u30da\u30f3\u306b","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4118810/7905ec67fbf07e5c1cc875b8c13da6e1b608095f.jpg"},{"name":"\u821e\u8e0f\u6d3e\u60c5\u7dd2\u3055\u3093","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4118810/4350545c00c1df640c81c3465554f9f1545205ad.jpg"},{"name":"\u661f\u6d77\uff30\u306e\u8a95\u751f\uff01","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4118810/3ec4f482e843e22bd7293daef211ff4e4db333d1.jpg"},{"name":"\u521d\u914d\u4fe1\u3067\u304d\u305a\uff01","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4118810/319a4954848a180e4bd950debf3e15866786cb54.jpg"},{"name":"\u5316\u6b69\u3068\u306e\u51fa\u4f1a\u3044","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4118810/5d210e0f223f6078e0fbf0ff6c06808df3e9dd76.jpg"},{"name":"\u30e1\u30c1\u3068\u30d0\u30b9\u30b1\uff01","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4118810/0a37be87a0aa3006afe6efa61034fdc02e9f6861.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4118810?t=1774227367","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.ste